    rdfs:label "Chronospecies prepattern inequality at 0 Ma" ;
    dct:description "What changes versus predecessor grimshawi and successor heteroneura at this scale and age | Variables: grimshawi anisotropy 315/100; heteroneura activator 240; guttifera activator 100" ;
    dct:source "Koshikawa et al. 2015 DOI:10.1073/pnas.1509022112; Koseki et al. 2021 DOI:10.1007/s00427-021-00674-z" ;
